{"5050840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Jumper", "steam_appid": 5050840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumper is a fast, endless hopping game. Steer through the air, land on platforms, and climb as far as you can before you miss and fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls, hard to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move in any direction to line up your next jump. As you climb, platforms shrink, slide, and vanish. One missed bounce and you’re done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stats and Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements for high scores, challenge completions, and persistence. Track your stats and keep pushing for new records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with keyboard, mouse, or gamepad. Steam Input and Steam Deck are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/extras/ce2dfcdf41e81769bf93c785cd888bcf.poster.avif?t=1786160865\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/extras/ce2dfcdf41e81769bf93c785cd888bcf.webm?t=1786160865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/extras/ce2dfcdf41e81769bf93c785cd888bcf.mp4?t=1786160865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumper is a fast, endless hopping game. Steer through the air, land on platforms, and climb as far as you can before you miss and fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls, hard to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move in any direction to line up your next jump. As you climb, platforms shrink, slide, and vanish. One missed bounce and you’re done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stats and Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements for high scores, challenge completions, and persistence. Track your stats and keep pushing for new records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with keyboard, mouse, or gamepad. Steam Input and Steam Deck are supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/extras/ce2dfcdf41e81769bf93c785cd888bcf.poster.avif?t=1786160865\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/extras/ce2dfcdf41e81769bf93c785cd888bcf.webm?t=1786160865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/extras/ce2dfcdf41e81769bf93c785cd888bcf.mp4?t=1786160865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "High score hopper. Steer through the air to land on shrinking, moving, and breaking platforms. Climb as far as you can before you miss and fall.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/d33e418da19ab633564b04101f7b9c82b5de30e0/header.jpg?t=1786160865", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5050840/94b69fb212795aa56ea56d0f663bf624678e1295/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786160865", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/